    "text": "kvnutalk\nwebsite\nLogan\nLogan's oldest troop travled eighty one days in Logan Canyon\n1 days ago\nLOGAN – Logan’s oldest Troop, Troop 1, has been in service for 115 years and the troop is combined with boys and girls. They embarked on their backpacking trips this year and spent 81 days in nature, traveling 1,152 miles. With each trip they went on, each scout had an option of going or wishing to stay home.",
